  "statement": "Opus 5.5 High approved renewal at rendered-80f2f6091a0af8643aa8 after a read-only comparison of the candidate binding, the six-line workflow addition, and the prior author receipt. This approval is workflow-only continuity. The 101 earlier finding dispositions, evidence and limits are carried forward unchanged; no new content review is claimed.",
