  "limits": "I did not run the full publication gate, the build or the browser tests. I did not reread cited sources or re-adjudicate the 101 inherited findings. Interface wording was checked by exact string search and line inspection, not by rendering every page. Known non-blocking limits: an unanswered issue is labelled Pending in the summary and review lists, though status text and filters mark it unfinished; the Pending value-summary note says the value can still be completed even while some issues are unanswered, in which case completion is refused with a request to review every issue. No human has tested comprehension, workload, speed or reliability, and no reduced-effort claim is made.",
