    "prior_statement": "As Opus 5.5 High, I approve as final author the exact reviewer-facing prose of the S.1582 issue-review pilot at canonical binding rendered-b91bff2229bf49288c1f and derived issue release s1582-issues-fdb283b53f1d794906b5 (rendered-1aa1f935d40db7414f26): the 49-issue grouping with its titles and introductions, every string in issues/ui-copy.json, and the new interface and error wording in the issue-review source files. I authored the grouping and the copy after reading all 79 S.1582 arguments, responses, notes and supporting paths and the three judged shared claims, and I checked the interface wording against the frozen source. I carry forward unchanged the 101 inherited finding approvals and dispositions after confirming that the canonical content, procedure, mapping, finding inventory and source index are unchanged. The publication gate changed in only two narrow ways: it accepts author approval of the dispositions by their exact hash, and it resolves the independent verification evidence, by exact hash, from selected fields of the existing public baseline verification receipt (review-receipts/review-interface-verification.json). Its other checks are unchanged. No argument, response, note, quotation, citation, shared claim or reference profile was changed. I approve the 101 dispositions by their exact digest: dispositions_sha256 is the SHA-256 of the repository stable() serialization of release/publication.json findings, which is identical to the public baseline at commit 901ff1cfd4cedff6371c36a6910fac19ade5e152.",
